{"displayStem":"한 사람의 등척성 피로 과제를 모사한 자료다. 가는 최대 자발 수축 힘, 나는 휴식 상태에서 최대상 운동신경 자극으로 유발한 단일연축 힘이다. 나의 검사는 매번 같은 사전 수축과 대기시간으로 강화 상태를 맞췄다. 전극·자세·근육 길이는 고정하였다. 과제 순서 0은 시작 전이고 1~5는 동일 과제 뒤의 검사 순서다. 각 점은 설계된 값으로 독립 표본이나 오차막대를 뜻하지 않는다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육용 합성 자료"}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence b06-questions\"><div class=\"evidence\"><div class=\"measurement-panels\"><figure class=\"measurement-panel\"><figcaption>반복 과제 전후 힘</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 580 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"반복 과제 전후 힘。과제 순서、힘 (N)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"580\" height=\"355\" fill=\"white\"></rect><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"526\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"20\" y=\"25\">힘 (N)</text><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"76\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"186\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"186\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"186\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1.5</text><line x1=\"296\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"296\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"296\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><line x1=\"406\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"406\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"406\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4.5</text><line x1=\"516\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"516\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"516\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"234\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"185.5\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"185.5\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"190.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">32.5</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"147\" text-anchor=\"end\">65</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"98.5\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"98.5\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"103.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">97.5</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"end\">130</text><polyline points=\"76,68.38461538461539 149.33333333333331,76.41538461538462 222.66666666666666,84.44615384615383 296,95.15384615384616 369.3333333333333,104.52307692307691 442.6666666666667,113.8923076923077\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-dasharray=\"none\"></polyline><circle cx=\"76\" cy=\"68.38461538461539\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"149.33333333333331\" cy=\"76.41538461538462\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"222.66666666666666\" cy=\"84.44615384615383\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"296\" cy=\"95.15384615384616\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"369.3333333333333\" cy=\"104.52307692307691\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"442.6666666666667\" cy=\"113.8923076923077\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"301\" r=\"3\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><text x=\"97\" y=\"306\">가</text><polyline points=\"76,188.84615384615384 149.33333333333331,191.52307692307693 222.66666666666666,195.53846153846155 296,199.55384615384617 369.3333333333333,202.23076923076923 442.6666666666667,204.90769230769232\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"></polyline><rect x=\"73.9\" y=\"186.74615384615385\" width=\"4.2\" height=\"4.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"147.23333333333332\" y=\"189.42307692307693\" width=\"4.2\" height=\"4.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"220.56666666666666\" y=\"193.43846153846155\" width=\"4.2\" height=\"4.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"293.9\" y=\"197.45384615384617\" width=\"4.2\" height=\"4.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"367.2333333333333\" y=\"200.13076923